#1. LOG CORRELATED TO GR FROM SUITE 1/RUN 1 ON 8-NOV-1996.
#2. TOOLS RUN AS PER TOOL SKETCH, WITH MCFL AND DENSITY ECCENTRALIZED BY PEX CALI
#3. CNT ECCENTRALIZED WITH BOW SPRING.
#4. 1.5" STAND OFFS ON THE AMS, SDC, SLR, SLS AND HALS.
#5. 2 LOGGING PASSES WERE MADE TO AQUIRE BOTH AS WAVEFORMS AND PEX DATA.
#6. NITRIDE TRACER ADDED TO MUD PRIOR TO LOGGING.
#7. GR AND AS WAVEFORMS AQUIRED TO 2210 THROUGH 9-5/8" CASING.
#8. ARRAY SONIC WAVE FORM TAPING RECORDED OVER THE ENTIRE INTERVAL.
#9. REPEAT SECTION PRESENTED FROM 2950 M TO 2820 M FOR WAVEFORMS, 3010 TO 2950 FO
#10.LIGHT CEMENT FROM 2800M UPWARDS PREVENTED GOOD SONIC DATA AQUISITION THROUGH
~A
